[37.041457, "o", "244|ST-514|concern|violation only|CL-309|I am concerned that Ms Corwin may not appreciate that these stays violate the custodial order.\r\n245|ST-515|addressee|mother|OI-201|This letter goes to counsel for Ms Corwin — the mother's attorney.\r\n246|ST-516|addressee|father|CL-301|Address the letter to the father's attorney.\r\n247|ST-517|addressee|father|OI-299|To counsel for Mr Adler.\r\n248|ST-518|request|CL match|OI-208|Neither child overnight in her care unless the father is present.\r\n249|ST-519|request|unless mother|CL-302|Neither child overnight in her care unless Ms Corwin is present.\r\n250|ST-520|delivery|post|OI-204|Send it by post to counsel's office.\r\n251|ST-521|delivery|email|CL-306|Send the letter by email to opposing counsel.\r\n252|ST-522|delivery|courier|OI-299|Deliver by courier to counsel's office.\r\n253|ST-523|copies|nobody|OI-205|Do not copy anyone on this letter.\r\n254|ST-524|copies|copy father|CL-305|Copy: Mr Adler.\r\n255|ST-525|enclosure|certified|OI-209|A certified copy of the custodial plan is encl"]
[37.041788, "o", "osed.\r\n256|ST-526|enclosure|unsigned|CL-303|An unsigned draft of the custodial plan is enclosed.\r\n257|ST-527|salutation|Dear Counsel|OI-211|Dear Counsel,\r\n258|ST-528|salutation|Dear Mr Adler|CL-304|Dear Mr Adler,\r\n259|ST-529|children_named|both with ages|CL-301|This concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\n260|ST-530|children_named|both no ages|OI-203|This concerns Noor and Imogen.\r\n261|ST-531|children_named|Noor only|CL-304|This concerns Noor, aged seven.\r\n262|ST-532|right_of_first_refusal|full|CL-306|Mr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal, so the children are not to be left overnight without him present.\r\n263|ST-533|right_of_first_refusal|mother agreed|OI-202|Ms Corwin agreed to a right of first refusal, so the children are not to be left overnight without her present.\r\n264|ST-534|right_of_first_refusal|agreement only no overnight|OI-202|Mr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal.\r\n"]
[37.042051, "o", "265|ST-535|overnight_stays|full|CL-302|On several occasions both children stayed overnight at her home or with a sitter while the father was away.\r\n266|ST-536|overnight_stays|home only|OI-204|On several occasions both children stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\n267|ST-537|overnight_stays|one child|CL-301|On several occasions Imogen stayed overnight at her home or with a sitter while the father was away.\r\n268|ST-538|inconsistent_accounts|all four|CL-303|Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as his wife to the school, as the person Imogen lives with to her clinicians, as a babysitter to me, and as his partner to the neighbours.\r\n"]
[37.042382, "o", "269|ST-539|inconsistent_accounts|three no neighbour|OI-205|Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as his wife to the school, as the person Imogen lives with to her clinicians, and as a babysitter to me.\r\n270|ST-540|sender_signature|full name|CL-305|Yours sincerely, Delphine Marr.\r\n271|ST-541|sender_signature|as counsel|OI-211|Yours sincerely, for Delphine Marr, solicitor.\r\n272|ST-542|sender_signature|first name only|CL-302|Yours sincerely, Delphine.\r\n273|ST-543|request|wording delivery|OI-208|Send it by post to counsel's office.\r\n274|ST-544|tone|wording copies|OI-210|Do not copy anyone on this letter.\r\n275|ST-545|concern|wording enclosure|CL-309|A certified copy of the custodial plan is enclosed.\r\n"]
[37.0427, "o", "276|ST-546|delivery|wording salutation|CL-306|Dear Counsel,\r\n277|ST-547|behavioural_plan|wording addressee mother|OI-207|This letter goes to counsel for Ms Corwin — the mother's attorney.\r\n278|ST-548|reply_deadline|7 days|OI-210|Please reply within seven days.\r\n279|ST-549|reply_deadline|14 days|CL-307|A reply within fourteen days is requested.\r\n280|ST-550|school_reference|principal|OI-205|The school principal can confirm the account.\r\n281|ST-551|mediation_offer|open|CL-309|I remain willing to mediate.\r\n282|ST-552|legal_fees|shared|OI-201|Legal fees will be shared equally.\r\n283|ST-553|court_listing|directions|CL-306|List the matter for directions within 28 days.\r\n284|ST-554|expert_report|joint|OI-207|I propose a joint expert on the overnight arrangements.\r\n285|ST-555|interim_contact|supervised|CL-302|Interim contact should be supervised only.\r\n286|ST-556|without_prejudice|mark letter|OI-211|This letter is sent without prejudice.\r\n"]
[37.043016, "o", "287|ST-557|hearing_bundle|bundle index enclosed|CL-301|A hearing bundle index is enclosed for the court.\r\n288|ST-558|tone|firm formal brief|OI-201|Adopt a firm, formal and brief style.\r\n289|ST-559|concern|position only|OI-299|I raise only the position she has been put in.\r\n"]
