[70.455687, "o", "  ST-316|pos=father's attorney|cite=CL-301|To counsel for Mr Adler.\r\n  ST-317|pos=father's attorney|cite=OI-299|Please send this to Adam's attorney.\r\n  ST-416|pos=father directly not mother's attorney|cite=OI-201|Address the letter to the father directly.\r\n  ST-515|pos=mother|cite=OI-201|This letter goes to counsel for Ms Corwin — the mother's attorney.\r\n  ST-516|pos=father|cite=CL-301|Address the letter to the father's attorney.\r\n  ST-517|pos=father|cite=OI-299|To counsel for Mr Adler.\r\n\r\n==== behavioural_plan ====\r\n  ST-107|pos=the stays have had no effect on the plan|cite=OI-207|Imogen's behavioural plan focuses on her confidence and stability, and the stays have not affected her progress.\r\n  ST-139|pos=confidence and setback missing stability|cite=CL-302|Imogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence, and the stays have set back her progress.\r\n  ST-150|pos=stays improved the plan|cite=OI-207|Imogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence and stability, and the stays have improved her progress.\r\n  ST-1"]
