[304.973187, "o", "e letter goes to Catherine's attorney.\r\nST-306 | VERIFIED | CL-301 | pos=mother's attorney | cite=OI-210 | To counsel for the mother.\r\nST-315 | AT_ODDS | CL-301 | pos=father's attorney | cite=OI-201 | Address the letter to the father's attorney.\r\nST-317 | AT_ODDS | CL-301 | pos=father's attorney | cite=OI-299 | Please send this to Adam's attorney.\r\nST-416 | AT_ODDS | CL-301 | pos=father directly not mother's attorney | cite=OI-201 | Address the letter to the father directly.\r\nST-515 | VERIFIED | CL-301 | pos=mother | cite=OI-201 | This letter goes to counsel for Ms Corwin — the mother's attorney.\r\nST-516 | AT_ODDS | CL-301 | pos=father | cite=CL-301 | Address the letter to the father's attorney.\r\nST-517 | AT_ODDS | CL-301 | pos=father | cite=OI-299 | To counsel for Mr Adler.\r\n\r\n======== request ========\r\n"]
[304.973415, "o", "ST-108 | VERIFIED | CL-302 | pos=no overnight stays in her care unless the father is present | cite=CL-302 | I ask that neither child remain overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\nST-117 | VERIFIED | CL-302 | pos=no overnight stays unless father present | cite=OI-208 | I ask that neither child remain overnight in her care unless the father is present.\r\nST-123 | VERIFIED | CL-302 | pos=no overnight unless father present | cite=CL-302 | Neither child should remain overnight in her care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\nST-125 | VERIFIED | CL-302 | pos=no overnight stays unless father present | cite=OI-208 | Neither child is to stay overnight in her care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\n"]
