[304.974081, "o", "\nST-215 | VERIFIED | CL-302 | pos=neither child overnight unless father present | cite=OI-202 | The request is that neither child remain overnight in her care unless the father is present.\r\nST-301 | VERIFIED | CL-302 | pos=CL wording exact | cite=OI-208 | Neither child overnight in her care unless the father is present.\r\nST-302 | VERIFIED | CL-302 | pos=CL wording paraphrase | cite=OI-211 | I ask that neither child remain overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\nST-303 | VERIFIED | CL-302 | pos=CL wording paraphrase | cite=OI-299 | Neither child should stay overnight with her unless the father is there.\r\nST-319 | AT_ODDS | CL-302 | pos=father alone overnight ok | cite=CL-302 | Either child may remain overnight in her care even if the father is away.\r\nST-415 | AT_ODDS | CL-302 | pos=meeting request not overnight condition | cite=OI-208 | I am writing to request a meeting with counsel.\r\nST-518 | VERIFIED | CL-302 | pos=CL match | cite=OI-208 | Neither child overnight in her care unless the fat"]
[304.974417, "o", "her is present.\r\nST-519 | AT_ODDS | CL-302 | pos=unless mother | cite=CL-302 | Neither child overnight in her care unless Ms Corwin is present.\r\nST-543 | AT_ODDS | CL-302 | pos=wording delivery | cite=OI-208 | Send it by post to counsel's office.\r\n\r\n======== enclosure ========\r\nST-109 | VERIFIED | CL-303 | pos=a certified copy of the custodial plan | cite=OI-209 | A certified copy of the custodial plan is enclosed.\r\nST-126 | VERIFIED | CL-303 | pos=a certified copy of the custodial plan | cite=OI-209 | A certified copy of the custodial plan is enclosed with this letter.\r\nST-134 | VERIFIED | CL-303 | pos=an uncertified summary of the plan | cite=OI-209 | An uncertified summary of the custodial plan is enclosed.\r\nST-154 | VERIFIED | CL-303 | pos=certified copy enclosed | cite=OI-209 | A certified copy of the custodial plan is enclosed.\r\nST-173 | VERIFIED | CL-303 | pos=certified copy | cite=OI-209 | A certified copy of the custodial plan is enclosed with this letter.\r\nST-174 | AT_ODDS | CL-303 | pos=certified c"]
