[304.975651, "o", "ce of opposing counsel.\r\nST-147 | AT_ODDS | CL-306 | pos=sent by email | cite=CL-306 | The letter shall be sent by email to counsel.\r\nST-158 | VERIFIED | CL-306 | pos=by post | cite=OI-299 | The letter shall be sent by post to counsel's office.\r\nST-178 | VERIFIED | CL-306 | pos=by post | cite=OI-210 | Send it by post to counsel's office.\r\nST-179 | VERIFIED | CL-306 | pos=by post | cite=OI-204 | The letter is to be sent by post to the offices of opposing counsel.\r\nST-183 | AT_ODDS | CL-306 | pos=by courier | cite=OI-299 | Deliver by courier to counsel.\r\nST-213 | AT_ODDS | CL-306 | pos=by courier | cite=OI-204 | Deliver this letter by courier to counsel's office.\r\n"]
