[304.976459, "o", "ST-119 | AT_ODDS | CL-307 | pos=firm and detailed | cite=OI-210 | The position is set out firmly and in full detail below.\r\nST-127 | AT_ODDS | CL-307 | pos=warm and personal | cite=OI-210 | The letter is written in a warm and personal tone, reflecting the ongoing relationship between the parents.\r\nST-137 | AT_ODDS | CL-307 | pos=firm and at length | cite=CL-304 | Set out the position firmly and at length.\r\nST-186 | AT_ODDS | CL-307 | pos=firm and direct | cite=CL-305 | Keep the letter firm and direct.\r\nST-187 | AT_ODDS | CL-307 | pos=firm and direct | cite=CL-306 | The tone throughout is firm and direct.\r\nST-200 | AT_ODDS | CL-307 | pos=firm detailed | cite=CL-302 | I set out the position firmly and in full detail.\r\nST-229 | AT_ODDS | CL-307 | pos=soft formal but detailed | cite=OI-210 | I keep the tone soft and formal, and I set the facts out in full detail.\r\nST-350 | AT_ODDS | CL-307 | pos=soft but not succinct | cite=CL-302 | The tone is soft and formal, and the facts are set out at length.\r\n"]
